# The workspace that lets this module and its consuming tools be edited
# together lives at ~/projects/go.work, outside every repository. These two
# entries are a safety net for a workspace created inside the checkout by
# mistake: a committed go.work makes CI resolve sibling modules from a
# developer's disk instead of the proxy, which is the same failure a
# committed `replace` directive causes — green locally, red or wrong in CI.
/go.work
/go.work.sum
